base.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
# Quasi-2D slab for the spray jet: periodic in x and z, symmetry in y
#=======================================================================
Box
-40  -20  -1                                         nelx,nely,nelz
0 2 1.                                               x0,x1,ratio
0 1 1.                                               y0,y1,ratio
0 0.1 1.                                            z0,z1,ratio
P  ,P  ,SYM,SYM,P  ,P                                bc's  (3 chars each!)
